# boxhuman — fold a limb to its limit, then walk all four deformation modes.
# Opens on SPINE (the Bezier (t,s) bind + miter clamp), then SPACE to DQS, LBS
# and RIGID so the same pose is drawn four ways. C at the end drops the clamp.
down 40 F
up   42 F
down 120 SPACE
up   122 SPACE
down 190 SPACE
up   192 SPACE
down 260 SPACE
up   262 SPACE
